URL: https://restoapp.com/admin/catalog/products
Path: Sidebar -> Catalog -> Products -> Select "origin" from the terminal dropdown.
Description: Hierarchical tree view of the product catalog. Shows root folders like restoapp.com, Add-ons, Sides, Sauces, etc.

Annotation:
- Red circle on Category Tree Sidebar area
- Red circle on the terminal selector dropdown (e.g. "origin")
- Red circles on root folders (e.g. "restoapp.com", "Add-ons") in the tree
